        <mxCell id="c29" value="4.1 is the only place produce leaves stock, and it locks the product rows in ascending id order so two simultaneous orders queue instead of overselling or deadlocking. 4.6 distinguishes a customer who did not come from one whose order was never answered (3.8): only the first is recorded against the account." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
